SET Support = "A previous attempt to predict drugs for the Mpro of SARS-CoV has identified two HIV-1 protease inhibitors, namely lopinavir and ritonavir, as potential candidates, both of which bind to the same target site of Mpro (Nukoolkarn et al., 2008). The conserved amino acids Thr24-Asn28 and Asn119 (numbered according to positions in SARS- CoV Mpro because the present sequence of 2019-nCoV Mpro in GenBank is in polypeptide form) formed the binding pockets for lopinavir/ritonavir in the spatial structure of both SARS-CoV Mpro and 2019-nCoV Mpro, whereas the nearby non-conserved amino acids locate far away from the binding pocket, thus would not affect its structural conservation (Fig. 1B)."
complex(a(CHEBI:"lopinavir"),p(ECCODE:"3.4.22.69",frag("119_119"))) negativeCorrelation bp(MESHPP:"Virus Replication")
UNSET Support
